ath","value":"Mgsin\\alpha +F_{\\text{库}}=k_{0}x"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得A球受到的库仑力为："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{库}}=2Mgsin\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故选A．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q14","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"89e5199c65cc38c557fdb86e3bdb5a3967a0b9490b6eb18a74ab0270e32ab24d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"由玻尔原子模型求得氢原子能级如图所示，已知可见光的光子能量在1.62eV到3.11eV之间，则（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2e4864be3fb65c3ed29ecc710fcb6efc46f676e3b0dd805948d0b748571b5c38.png","width":930,"height":720,"width_mm":59.53,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q14-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"氢原子从高能级向低能级跃迁时可能辐射出"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"射线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"氢原子从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级向"},{"type":"math","value":"n=2"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级跃迁时会辐射出红外线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"处于"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"能级的氢原子可以吸收任意频率的紫外线并发生电离"}],[{"type":"text","value":"大量氢原子从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=4"},{"type":"text","value":"能级向低能级跃迁时可辐射出2种频率的可见光"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"射线为重核衰变或裂变时才会放出，氢原子跃迁无法辐射"},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"射线，故A错误；\nB．氢原子从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级向"},{"type":"math","value":"n=2"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级辐射光子的能量：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E=-1.51eV-(-3.40eV)=1.89eV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在可见光范围之内，故B错误；\nC．氢原子在"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"能级吸收"},{"type":"math","value":"1.51eV"},{"type":"text","value":"的光子能量就可以电离，紫外线的最小频率大于"},{"type":"math","value":"1.51eV"},{"type":"text","value":"，可以使处于"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"能级的氢原子电离，故C正确；\nD．氢原子从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=4"},{"type":"text","value":"能级跃迁至"},{"type":"math","value":"n=2"},{"type":"text","value":"能级辐射光子的能量：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E'=-0.85eV-(-3.40eV)=2.55eV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在可见光范围之内；同理，从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=3"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级向"},{"type":"math","value":"n=2"},{"type":"text","value":"的能级辐射光子的能量也在可见光范围之内，所以大量氢原子从"},{"type":"math","value":"n=4"},{"type":"text","value":"能级向低能级跃迁时可辐射出2种频率的可见光，故D正确。\n故选CD．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q15","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d87af2e7d866ad720070191c636e60a405be52f941fd5b77eec59546cf1cf123","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，波长为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"的两种单色光射入三棱镜，经折射后射出两束单色光a和b，则这两束光（填空） \n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bc6400a684b727c488d995a0938849624f019d6537610530cfe2f007d9fea574.png","width":708,"height":675,"width_mm":47.62,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q15-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"照射同一种金属均有光电子逸出，光电子最大初动能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{Ka}>E_{Kb}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"射向同一双缝干涉装置，其干涉条纹间距"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_{a}>\\Delta x_{b}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"在水中的传播速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}<v_{b}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"光子动量"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{a}<p_{b}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．根据光路图可知三棱镜对b光的偏折程度更大，所以b光折射率大，频率高，波长短。根据光电效应方程：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"h\\nu =W_{0}+E_{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu _{b}>\\nu _{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{Kb}>E_{Ka}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故A错误；\nB．根据双缝干涉条纹间距公式：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=\\frac{l}{d}\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{a}>\\lambda _{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x_{a}>\\Delta x_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故B正确；\nC．介质中传播速度：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{c}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{b}>n_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{a}>v_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故C错误；\nD．根据光子动量的公式：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"p=\\frac{h}{\\lambda}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda _{a}>\\lambda _{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{b}>p_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故D正确。\n故选BD．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q16","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1fa65dfb24dd498d9292cef9e6e1743fd8dc8a212b2461867797fd3b4137d6cd","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，波源O垂直于纸面做简谐运动，所激发的横波在均匀介质中向四周传播，图中虚线表示两个波面。"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，离O点5m的A点开始振动；"},{"type":"math","value":"t=1s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，离O点10m的B点也开始振动，此时A点第五次回到平衡位置，则（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ed8f03c141fb5eed5248731ca95a400dcaeaca599b7ed86c42f0a26683ad333e.png","width":1080,"height":830,"width_mm":44.71,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q16-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"波的周期为0.4s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"波的波长为2m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"波速为"},{"type":"math","value":"5\\sqrt{3}m/s"}],[{"type":"math","value":"t=1s"},{"type":"text","value":"时AB连线上有4个点处于最大位移"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AB","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．经过"},{"type":"math","value":"1s"},{"type":"text","value":"时A第五次回到平衡位置，即：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"2.5T=1s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得周期："},{"type":"math","value":"T=0.4s"},{"type":"text","value":"，故A正确；\nBC．根据题意可知波速：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{10m-5m}{1s}=5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n波长：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda =vT=5\\times 0.4m=2m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故B正确，C错误；\nD．"},{"type":"math","value":"1s"},{"type":"text","value":"时A处于平衡位置，根据波长和两点之间距离可知，AB之间有"},{"type":"math","value":"2.5"},{"type":"text","value":"个波形，因此有"},{"type":"math","value":"5"},{"type":"text","value":"个点处于最大位移处，故D错误。\n故选AB．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q17","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"76a68238dd1e03c1598c312034718ce8c2b088b6e0939fdc9c32eed62bcddc44","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”和用橡皮筋“探究做功与物体速度变化的关系”实验中\n（1）都是通过分析纸带上的点来测量物理量，下列说法正确的是（填空）\nA.都需要分析打点计时器打下的第一个点    B.都不需要分析打点计时器打下的第一个点\nC.一条纸带都只能获得一组数据    D.一条纸带都能获得多组数据\n（2）如图是两条纸带的一部分，A、B、C、…、G是纸带上标出的计数点，每两个相邻的计数点之间还有4个打出的点未画出。其中图（填空）（填“甲”或“乙”）所示的是用橡皮筋“探究做功与物体速度变化的关系”的实验纸带。“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”实验中，小车的加速度大小a=（填空）m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（保留2位有效数字）。\n（3）在用橡皮筋“探究做功与物体速度变化的关系”实验中，平衡阻力后，小车与橡皮筋组成的系统在橡皮筋恢复形变前机械能（填空）（填“守恒”或“不守恒”）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/af2d5deba324c6218f76659ac578190d2056b1049502c605583f0c2b5c09b372.png","width":1528,"height":713,"width_mm":139.96,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q17-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】    ①  BC    ②  甲    ③  0.40    ④  不守恒\n【详解】（1）AB．在“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”和用橡皮筋“探究做功与物体速度变化的关系”实验中均不需要打下的第一个点，前者主要利用纸带求解加速度，后者主要研究两点间的动能的变化，无需从第一个点进行研究。故A错误，B正确；\nCD．牛顿第二定律实验探究一条纸带只能求解一个加速度，找到加速度a与质量m和合外力F的一组对应关系；动能定理探究也是从一条纸带上选择两个点作为一组数据进行过程分析，故C正确，D错误。\n（2）甲图中纸带后边是匀速直线运动，说明甲图应为用橡皮筋“探究做功与物体速度变化的关系”实验；\n对乙纸带采用逐差法求解加速度：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{x_{DG}-x_{AD}}{9T^{2}}=0.40m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）小车与橡皮筋在运动过程中，除了斜面的摩擦力外还会受到空气的阻力作用，故平衡摩擦力运动过程中机械能不守恒。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q18","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"实验题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cfeaf20e7c7cea9d34ed3999c73a855691bbf40a9acc3d4ebf5018767893a73c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）小明同学用多用电表测量一未知电阻器的阻值。经过规范操作后，所选欧姆挡倍率及指针位置分别如图甲、乙所示，则此电阻器的阻值为（填空）Ω\n（2）在“测绘小灯泡的伏安特性曲线”实验中：\n①如图丙所示，已经连接了一部分电路，请在答题纸上对应位置将电路连接完整（填空）。\n②合上开关后，测出9组I、U值，在"},{"type":"math","value":"I-U"},{"type":"text","value":"坐标系中描出各对应点，如图丁所示。请在答题纸对应位置的图中画出此小灯泡的伏安特性曲线（填空）。\n③与图丁中P点对应的状态，小灯泡灯丝阻值最接近（填空）。\nA.16.7Ω    B.12.4Ω    C.6.2Ω\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ac8183a6de9aaae3ba3cdbd42a800fe0ef9a2d5221b3cf8d450413b358814616.png","width":5250,"height":2080,"width_mm":152.93,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/db04c852b352eab5c52cb98c68483e82fc1ea952363fd3d2482454bb375e8d0b.png","width":436,"height":439,"width_mm":61.65,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q18-row2"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/17821795c9c89576b21c40c5c333ddba03f348ff127623927e46d132faab4938.png","width":662,"height":630,"width_mm":66.94,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q18-row3"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】    ①  1750（1700～1800）    ②  "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9f762c68d30e1b9de532f7abc4985ad88a36c96212652ff168ae1e6e953f776f.png","width":1690,"height":1480,"width_mm":58.21},{"type":"text","value":"    ③ "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e86ab8c2a9c6b1cd6f7442287b2c2bd0ad83fd7ee59c3d96d5cec33f74016037.png","width":666,"height":589,"width_mm":73.29},{"type":"text","value":"    ④ C\n【详解】（1）阻值为欧姆表盘读数乘以倍率：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"17.5\\times 100\\Omega =1750\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）①根据图丁可知电压表选择0到3V量程即可，数据从0开始测量，滑动变阻器采用分压接法：\n（见上方配图）\n②用平滑曲线画出伏安特性曲线：\n（见上方配图）\n③根据图像结合欧姆定律：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{1.40V}{0.23A}\\approx 6.09\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以C选项的电阻较为接近。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q19","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3f1bd4de6ed6408c9434005e0517a0292270f1a34a7b8ec57f1c965a0bc450b1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"本卷可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n一个无风晴朗的冬日，小明乘坐游戏滑雪车从静止开始沿斜直雪道匀变速下滑，滑行54m后进入水平雪道，继续滑行40.5m后匀减速到零。已知小明和滑雪车的总质量为60kg，整个滑行过程用时10.5s，斜直雪道倾角为37°"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left( \\sin 37^{\\circ}=0.6 \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"。求小明和滑雪车：\n（1）滑行过程中的最大速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"的大小；\n（2）在斜直雪道上滑行的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（3）在斜直雪道上受到的平均阻力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"的大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d16a395ffcecab2c0c9573cdc49a030f401e0665a9296f293c251e1c0b6b5afa.png","width":1067,"height":574,"width_mm":59,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q19-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1) "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=18m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"； (2) "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=6s"},{"type":"text","value":" ；(3) "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}=180N"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n【详解】（1）小明和滑雪车在斜面上滑行时做初速度为0的匀加速的直线运动，在水平上滑行时，做末速度为0的匀减速直线运动，由平均速度公式"},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{v}=\\frac{x}{t}=\\frac{v_{0}+v_{1}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得滑行分析运动过程可知：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=\\frac{v_{m}}{2}\\cdot t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=\\frac{v_{m}}{2}\\cdot t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则整个过程有：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{m}}{2}=\\frac{x_{1}+x_{2}}{t_{1}+t_{2}}=\\frac{54m+40.5m}{10.5s}=9m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=18m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）在斜直雪道上滑行过程中由"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=\\frac{v_{m}}{2}t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得，滑行的时间：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{2x_{1}}{v_{m}}=\\frac{2\\times 54m}{18m/s}=6s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）根据匀变速直线运动速度时间关系式"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_{0}+at"},{"type":"text","value":"可得小明和滑雪车在斜直雪道上的加速度：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{v_{m}}{t_{1}}=3m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由牛顿第二运动定律：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgsin37^{\\circ}-F_{f}=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}=180N"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q20","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"53da6db3c63a03934f597b11edc2507093f40dbe42d105246e3a374e9ed1862a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"本卷可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n如图所示，一弹射游戏装置由安装在水平台面上的固定弹射器、竖直圆轨道（在最低点E分别与水平轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"EO"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"EA"},{"type":"text","value":"相连）、高度h可调的斜轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"组成。游戏时滑块从O点弹出，经过圆轨道并滑上斜轨道。全程不脱离轨道且恰好停在B端则视为游戏成功。已知圆轨道半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r=0.1m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"OE"},{"type":"text","value":"长"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":"长"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}=0.4m"},{"type":"text","value":"，圆轨道和"},{"type":"math","value":"AE"},{"type":"text","value":"光滑，滑块与"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"OE"},{"type":"text","value":"之间的动摩擦因数"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu =0.5"},{"type":"text","value":"。滑块质量m=2g且可视为质点，弹射时从静止释放且弹簧的弹性势能完全转化为滑块动能。忽略空气阻力，各部分平滑连接。求\n\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/30853ffe2317ce6de102000d63379801eda4806709827b4883bd088f88bbc657.png","width":913,"height":333,"width_mm":97.63,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）滑块恰好能过圆轨道最高点F时的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}"},{"type":"text","value":"大小；\n（2）当"},{"type":"math","value":"h=0.1m"},{"type":"text","value":"且游戏成功时，滑块经过E点对圆轨道的压力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"大小及弹簧的弹性势能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（3）要使游戏成功，弹簧的弹性势能"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}"},{"type":"text","value":"与高度h之间满足的关系。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1) "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" (2) "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p0}=8.0\\times 10^{-3}J"},{"type":"text","value":" (3) "},{"type":"math","value":"0.05m\\le h\\le 0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）滑块恰过F点的条件：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=m\\frac{v{}_{F}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）滑块从E到B，动能定理：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"-mgh-\\mu mgL_{2}=0-\\frac{1}{2}mv{}_{E}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在E点根据牛顿第二定律：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-mg=m\\frac{v{}_{E}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=0.14N"},{"type":"text","value":"\n从O到B点，根据能量守恒定律：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p0}-mgh-\\mu mg\\left( L_{1}+L_{2} \\right)=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p0}=8.0\\times 10^{-3}J"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）滑块恰能过F点的弹性势能：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p1}=2mgr+\\mu mgL_{1}+\\frac{1}{2}mv{}_{F}^{2}=7.0\\times 10^{-3}J"},{"type":"text","value":"\n到B点减速到0：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p1}-mgh_{1}-\\mu mg\\left( L_{1}+L_{2} \\right)=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}=0.05m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n能停在B点，则：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mgcos\\theta =mgsin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\theta =0.5"},{"type":"text","value":"，此时"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n从O到B点：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=mgh+\\mu mg\\left( L_{1}+L_{2} \\right)=2\\times 10^{-3}(10h+3)J"},{"type":"text","value":"\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"0.05m\\le h\\le 0.2m"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q21","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q21","number":"21","order":21,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"516da7922df31059ae0af00a2cb31ce77f3e9016172316446dd4d5eb2da17d20","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图甲所示，在"},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":"水平面内，固定放置着间距为l的两平行金属直导轨，其间连接有阻值为R的电阻，电阻两端连接示波器（内阻可视为无穷大），可动态显示电阻R两端的电压。两导轨间存在大小为B、方向垂直导轨平面的匀强磁场。"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时一质量为m、长为l的导体棒在外力F作用下从"},{"type":"math","value":"x=x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 位置开始做简谐运动，观察到示波器显示的电压随时间变化的波形是如图乙所示的正弦曲线。取"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=-\\frac{U_{m}T}{2\\pi Bl}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则简谐运动的平衡位置在坐标原点O。不计摩擦阻力和其它电阻，导体棒始终垂直导轨运动。（提示：可以用"},{"type":"math","value":"F-x"},{"type":"text","value":"图象下的“面积”代表力F所做的功）\n（1）求导体棒所受到的安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"随时间t的变化规律；\n（2）求在0至0.25T时间内外力F的冲量；\n（3）若"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时外力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{0}=1N,l=1m,T=2\\pi s,m=1kg,R=1\\Omega ,U_{m}=0.5V,B=0.5T"},{"type":"text","value":"，求外力与安培力大小相等时棒的位置坐标和速度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ff5eb0bebc0041e9fa2677f6ca6dea3e8f277d7befbf246be9b45dd67540f6b4.png","width":1415,"height":442,"width_mm":161.66,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q21-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1) "},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{BlU_{m}}{R}\\sin \\frac{2\\pi}{T}t"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2) "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F}=\\frac{BlU_{m}T}{2\\pi R}+\\frac{mU_{m}}{Bl}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3) "},{"type":"math","value":"x{}_{1}^{'}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}m"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v{}_{1}^{'}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"type":"math","value":"x{}_{2}^{'}=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}m"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v{}_{2}^{'}=-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{ m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）由显示的波形可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"U=U_{m}\\sin \\frac{2\\pi}{T}t"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{U_{m}}{R}\\sin \\frac{2\\pi}{T}t"},{"type":"text","value":"\n安培力随时间变化规律：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=-BIl=-\\frac{BlU_{m}}{R}\\sin \\frac{2\\pi}{T}t"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）安培力的冲量：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{A}=-Bl\\Delta q=-\\frac{B^{2}\\left\\lvert x_{0} \\right\\rvert l^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由动量定理，有：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F}+I_{A}=mv_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F}=\\frac{BlU_{m}T}{2\\pi R}+\\frac{mU_{m}}{Bl}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）棒做简谐运动，有：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}+F=-kx"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=-F"},{"type":"text","value":"时：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"x=0"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\pm v_{m}=\\pm 1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=F"},{"type":"text","value":"时，设"},{"type":"math","value":"x=x^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v^{'}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=-\\frac{1}{2}kx^{'}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{0}=-kx_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"2x^{'}=v^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动能定理：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv^{'2}=\\frac{1}{2}k\\left( x{}_{0}^{2}-x^{'2} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"x{}_{1}^{'}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}m"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v{}_{1}^{'}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"type":"math","value":"x{}_{2}^{'}=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}m"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v{}_{2}^{'}=-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{ m/s}"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001-q22","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202001","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202001-q22","number":"22","order":22,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"929513a12a6f548c57c6156f6761ccdf3518faaec1e520c141da1948a761684b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"通过测量质子在磁场中的运动轨迹和打到探测板上的计数率（即打到探测板上质子数与衰变产生总质子数N的比值），可研究中子（"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{0}^{1}n"},{"type":"text","value":"）的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"衰变。中子衰变后转化成质子和电子，同时放出质量可视为零的反中微子"},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{\\nu}_{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"。如图所示，位于P点的静止中子经衰变可形成一个质子源，该质子源在纸面内各向均匀地发射N个质子。在P点下方放置有长度"},{"type":"math","value":"L=1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"以O为中点的探测板，P点离探测板的垂直距离"},{"type":"math","value":"OP"},{"type":"text","value":"为a。在探测板的上方存在方向垂直纸面向里，磁感应强度大小为B的匀强磁场。\n已知电子质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{e}=9.1\\times 10^{-31}kg=0.51MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，中子质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{n}=939.57MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，质子质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{p}=938.27MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（c为光速，不考虑粒子之间的相互作用）。\n若质子的动量"},{"type":"math","value":"p=4.8\\times 10^{-21}kg\\cdot m\\cdot s^{-1}=3\\times 10^{-8}MeV\\cdot s\\cdot m^{-1}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n（1）写出中子衰变的核反应式，求电子和反中微子的总动能（以"},{"type":"math","value":"MeV"},{"type":"text","value":"为能量单位）；\n（2）当"},{"type":"math","value":"a=0.15m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"B=0.1T"},{"type":"text","value":"时，求计数率；\n（3）若"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"取不同的值，可通过调节"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"的大小获得与（2）问中同样的计数率，求"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"的关系并给出"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"的范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cf8ef68c2277c9c8e0b9e4928a3870b7f1e020a58a31a219b8f86bd534864396.png","width":774,"height":396,"width_mm":98.16,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202001-q22-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1) "},{"type":"math","value":"0.7468MeV"},{"type":"text","value":" (2) "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" (3) "},{"type":"math","value":"B\\ge \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{40}T"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）核反应方程满足质量数和质子数守恒：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{0}^{1}n\\rightarrow {}_{1}^{1}p+{}_{-1}^{0}e+{}_{0}^{0}\\overline{\\nu}_{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n核反应过程中：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E_{d}=m_{n}c^{2}-\\left( m_{p}c^{2}+m_{e}c^{2} \\right)=0.79MeV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动量和动能关系：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{kp}=\\frac{p^{2}}{2m_{p}}=0.0432MeV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则总动能为：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{e}+E_{\\nu}=\\Delta E_{d}-E_{kp}=0.7468MeV"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）质子运动半径：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{p}{eB}=0.3m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n如图甲所示：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ebaf141140f05e92a5ff9100bbdc0b5e4d28b8583945e2d9747cb4479f711c19.png","width":616,"height":448,"width_mm":68.53},{"type":"text","value":"\n打到探测板对应发射角度：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha =\\beta =\\frac{\\pi}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得质子计数率为：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta =\\frac{\\frac{4\\pi}{3}}{2\\pi}=\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）在确保计数率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta =\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"的情况下：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R'=2a"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即："},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{3}{200a}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n如图乙所示：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cf03d27f3afba77860304ec31a11ea1b83dca31b58bae7c84b86a2876f966ec1.png","width":637,"height":304,"width_mm":75.14},{"type":"text","value":"\n恰能打到探测板左端的条件为：\n"},{"type":"math","value":"4R{}_{\\max}^{2}-\\frac{R{}_{\\max}^{2}}{4}=\\frac{L^{2}}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即："},{"type":"math","value":"B\\ge \\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{40}T"}]}}]}
